+#!/usr/bin/env python3
+"""Verified rooted road-trip covers from arXiv:1401.3909.
+
+The paper identifies one team's individual travel lower bound with the weight
+of a rooted 4-cycle-cover: every cycle is a road trip of at most three away
+games.  This module inverse-generates a metric and a minimum cover.  It samples
+the affine relabellings first and uses the rearrangement inequality to know the
+cover without running the assignment algorithm used as the Track-B baseline.
+"""
+
