+pair plays twice, once at each venue.  It is uniform when all X teams have the
+same home/away status in a slot.  No team may have more than three consecutive
+home games or away games (the at-most-three rule), and no team may face the same
+opponent in consecutive slots (the no-repeat rule).
 
