+> **Status:** the generator and every local gate pass. The mandatory multi-vendor hardening verdict is incomplete: OpenRouter returned HTTP 403 “Key limit exceeded” on every bare, structural-hint, and placebo redraw. Those script-owned errors are preserved and are not counted as model failures.
 
