The final construction audit is clean. The travel decomposition is exact: each triplet-pair block contributes fixed branch travel plus twice the relevant triangle perimeter; summing all blocks gives the rendered fixed term plus `2m` times the candidate Y-perimeters. The planted tree metric adds a strictly positive center penalty to every mixed triplet, so only the constructed fibers meet the threshold. The symbolic coefficient is sampled before tags and distances, and deleting or corrupting `inst["answer"]` does not affect verification.
