Implemented a verified Track B generator based on the paper’s Section 5 triplet-road construction ([paper](https://arxiv.org/pdf/1401.3909)).

Deliverables:

- [gen_1401_3909.py](/home/gson/gvrepo/results/1401.3909/gen_1401_3909.py)
